  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coordinated engagement in peacebuilding and conflict prevention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Coordinate concerted civil society action in the context of the IDPS, the 2030 Agenda (Particularly
SDG16+), NA4P and related policy domains.
2. Strengthen capacity and amplify the voice and agency of civil society in fragile and
conflict-affected settings through lobby and advocacy efforts and peer-2-peer learning.
3. Influence policy on fragility, peace, security and sustainable development at all levels to
consolidate civil society inclusion in policy dialogues.</narrative>
  </description>
